Like his games counterpart, his goal as a Trainer is to meet every Pokémon in the Pokédex as stated during his introduction. Throughout his , Trevor aims to take pictures of all the Pokémon he encounters. He is mostly interested in ones with differences in their features, however slight, as seen in A Legendary Photo Op!.

Trevor shares a close friendship with and as they been friends since they were little, and would met up with each other whenever they could during their journeys to pursue their goals. Trevor also has feelings for as he saw her Pokévision video many times before meeting her. During the Kalos League, Trevor quickly became friends with Sawyer and gets along really well with him.
